# LocaleHub

SPA React (Vite + Tailwind v4) for **developers** to edit i18n JSON on GitHub — not a TMS for PO/QA/translators. See `docs/features.md`.

## Hard facts

- Product: **LocaleHub** (npm `locale-hub`). UI brand via `ui.app.name` / `ui.app.logo`.
- Audience: **devs only** — no PO/QA workflow in the product.
- Config: `.env` + optional OAuth UI config. See `docs/setup.md`.
- Drafts: `localStorage` via `src/helpers/draftStorage.ts` — reload must keep uncommitted edits.
- **Session lost** (401/403): blocking `SessionLostModal`; user must reconnect via SetupWizard; draft preserved.
- Commit: single multi-file commit via `commitJsonFiles`, always via PR.
- Workspaces: translations (active) | configs (UI disabled). Config keys = camelCase.
- State hub: `src/hooks/useTranslationApp.ts`. UI shell: `src/App.tsx`.

## Docs

`README.md` → `docs/` (`features`, `setup`, `translations`, `workflow`, …). Agent map: `AGENTS.md`.

## When changing behavior

Update the matching file under `docs/` (and README links if needed). Do not reintroduce per-file Contents API commits or drop draft persistence.
